@title Parts pass: after a macro, the toast opens the Devices drawer on devices without a part
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Workflow gap row 5: placing a macro leaves devices without parts; one toast takes you to them.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "place macro"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button
wait 20
expect "without a part"
shot offer-toast
click_text "Choose parts" Button
wait 10
expect "Accept all"
expect "Device"
shot pass-open
key Down
wait 3
key Enter
wait 5
shot pass-after-enter
